    "detailed_description": "<h1>How to play:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy creatures from different factions and of various ranks. Build your army. Bring order to the city.<br>Each card in the game features unique mechanics and traits, demanding a wide range of strategies and combinations from the player.<br>Fight in the arena, complete campaigns, and take part in mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget to add the game to your wishlist!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207900/extras/0cc806ad4ed3c722cbaecdedf6e4e14e.avif?t=1754133599\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card strategy inspired by Auto Chess and Rogue-like games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a dream team from cards of different factions \u2014 police, bikers, gangsters, zombies, and superheroes. Buy and sell fighters, combine cards, power them up, and unlock powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your deck through unique Events and Company Bonuses. Upgrade the shop to get increasingly rare and dangerous creatures. Complete the campaign, strengthening your army after each battle \u2014 and step by step, conquer the Beast City.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card strategy inspired by Auto Chess and Rogue-like games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a dream team from cards of different factions \u2014 police, bikers, gangsters, zombies, and superheroes. Buy and sell fighters, combine cards, power them up, and unlock powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your deck through unique Events and Company Bonuses. Upgrade the shop to get increasingly rare and dangerous creatures. Complete the campaign, strengthening your army after each battle \u2014 and step by step, conquer the Beast City.</p>",
    "short_description": "A card strategy game inspired by the principles of Auto Chess and roguelike genres. Dive into a criminal beast-metropolis where cops, bikers, gangsters, zombies, and even superheroes battle for control of the streets. Build a crazy deck, combine faction abilities.",
